, omega_m=0.142, sigma_8=0.81, 799 bins each (finding f-028): weak-in (e_w=0.24, v_kin=0.155, eps_kin=0.08) in d10_weak_in/Pk-ratio_z0.0000_prediction.csv and strong-in (e_w=0.96, v_kin=1.145, eps_kin=1.14) in d10_strong_in/Pk-ratio_z0.0000_prediction.csv. Dead end x-06: load_table_data cannot parse these CSVs because of the comment lines and the text header.
